    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《做牙》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">藍春瑞</span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh7kU-5cNdgKe13Dn7tUS0vKLdzBYzsG3Xm9BEJkzz0lotIrYlUh25GF6aJkyGtOfR-yHOFVlrR_pPHA0x-WNVgrF-7dTrIgvYyjYE4x7g3xVvimR3qUBmMS7_2LfvP3pPIZbqw_qqS8WUXGYkOehRdBSp0dHn2HDgrTOWvht4nXzJRov8CzxkufGb0RpwP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh7kU-5cNdgKe13Dn7tUS0vKLdzBYzsG3Xm9BEJkzz0lotIrYlUh25GF6aJkyGtOfR-yHOFVlrR_pPHA0x-WNVgrF-7dTrIgvYyjYE4x7g3xVvimR3qUBmMS7_2LfvP3pPIZbqw_qqS8WUXGYkOehRdBSp0dHn2HDgrTOWvht4nXzJRov8CzxkufGb0RpwP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh9zlLHKXn0ausMjHsC3f5y44pzjp671zuns7e1b11m37KEfXd_ZTVw21oCh_caVHyTP0DSY4OHgMqj12jWHgIFT1v99naeGQAQrbcyofRghv8GpFAVDs2LR7ikq-rHzNO4xD10Njv1QPxlEqrDQbNjtMA1RuCPKUVy2xpMIYoRRM-_GntT-E-W9MHNSv62\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh9zlLHKXn0ausMjHsC3f5y44pzjp671zuns7e1b11m37KEfXd_ZTVw21oCh_caVHyTP0DSY4OHgMqj12jWHgIFT1v99naeGQAQrbcyofRghv8GpFAVDs2LR7ikq-rHzNO4xD10Njv1QPxlEqrDQbNjtMA1RuCPKUVy2xpMIYoRRM-_GntT-E-W9MHNSv62\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj07HfGza8JTVozFZapG42ORCOJ4wBpW-FfOqbBDP9_atz-ZMgUsRYBwPTpj0wvvmH3CFse1_zP0Ts2KFlk1dXiZLk3--mTSX08ezhS7SVanHxD8D6sWkJlb_KK7ux8_-ANaLpTR0GDtaw1s2AkXOGhcrDeUQ30CnlsHPYIspZeEPAR5g0_gyaCERpBv0Ho\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj07HfGza8JTVozFZapG42ORCOJ4wBpW-FfOqbBDP9_atz-ZMgUsRYBwPTpj0wvvmH3CFse1_zP0Ts2KFlk1dXiZLk3--mTSX08ezhS7SVanHxD8D6sWkJlb_KK7ux8_-ANaLpTR0GDtaw1s2AkXOGhcrDeUQ30CnlsHPYIspZeEPAR5g0_gyaCERpBv0Ho=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div><br /></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">早前社會ê生理人，lóng ē tī lán人初2、16做牙拜拜，煮一寡有油tsho ê好料理來巴結工人kah辛勞。M̄-koh hit-tsūn ê頭家人是為著伊家己有趁大錢ê ǹg望，tsiah ē tshuân牲禮拜土地公kah老大公，beh求平安順序，姑不將tsiah án-ne做--ê，iah無，khah有hiah-nī仔好死，beh hōo下跤手人食好料理--leh？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">頭家人規頭殼lóng leh想錢，見著銀票仔，目睭就thián大蕊。M̄-koh，伊若看著神、碰著鬼ê時，仝款跤手肉la̍k-la̍k-tshuah，驚kah kiōng-beh半小死。M̄-tsiah講做牙是pn̄g鬼kah神ê福氣，tsiah有thang食魚食肉、lim燒酒。頭家若khiû、儉，koh無神、無鬼，啥mi̍h lóng m̄驚ê時tsūn，tsit聲就無「牙」thang做，無tshenn-tshau thang食--ah。好佳哉，tī 50冬前ê台灣iáu m̄ bat聽講有tsit款頭家出現--過。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">做牙hit工ê透早，頭家ē hiàm煮飯仔去菜市仔買魚魚肉肉tńg--來，拜拜ê三牲有腿庫、雞鵤仔、大尾魚仔，用三塊桶盤分開té，koh煮一鼎大麵，內底摻肉絲、蝦卑仔、香菇，頂面hiù一寡真芳ê香油，kan-na鼻--著，就kiōng-beh流瀾。另外，ē kah幾項仔菜，比論講：冬粉煮卵湯、韭菜花炒小管、麻竹筍kûn排骨，mā是讚kah死無人ê好料理。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">拄好過晝ê時tsūn，煮飯仔kā mi̍h件排起去門喙ê桌仔頂，tsiah請頭家來拜拜。未拜ê進前，頭家ê目睭thián kah金sih-sih，uì桌邊se̍h一liàn-tńg透，斟酌看有phong-phài--無？心肝內順suà leh算煮飯仔所申領ê錢額，到底是買著啥mih碗糕料理？有ha̍h--無？有暗khàm--無？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">頭家人仔攑香做頭前，工人徛tī kha-tshng後，同齊tuè拜。圍tī邊--a iau kah大腸告小腸ê囡仔，m̄是beh看人按怎拜土地公伯--à，顛倒是對桌頂ê好料理leh注神，心肝leh想--ê是：「香khah ē過hiah慢--leh？」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Thìng候太白酒敬過三擺了後，煮飯仔kā teh-beh齊--過ê香跤總khiú--起-來，hiat去kah金紙做一伙燒掉ê時tsūn，頭家ē koh行出來用手拜拜，án-ne就煞--ah。煮飯仔tuè手kā三牲phâng入去灶跤切--開，另外用盤仔té，未phâng--出-來進前，頭家、辛勞全用徛--ê，早to圍tī桌邊，先té大麵配桌頂ê菜，大人、囡仔2、30雙箸、碗kah湯匙仔，bē輸iau飢失頓án-ne，食kah kiōng-beh kā桌仔píng--過。</span></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（Tsit篇文章bat刊tī教育部電子報，漢羅用字有調整，原文網址：https://reurl.cc/lak7XY）</span></div><div><br /></div></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtA5u4OQb_Qhl5q2r99aRgS6aKK_ffPVom911metAlMvWjhnC7eRVuRvdAi-JYwGM7Kv5NwYeNdkjU8KywNl4TnmKLFayyu7KXUobnNYpeBcJi_oUfFxcS3gzUehqHADr_-1fWxkOwfySOO9cprCDdPa-Bk1I9ves5cKU6r6Bhaqq2P9NT5WHzXJsAkybW\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2139\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtA5u4OQb_Qhl5q2r99aRgS6aKK_ffPVom911metAlMvWjhnC7eRVuRvdAi-JYwGM7Kv5NwYeNdkjU8KywNl4TnmKLFayyu7KXUobnNYpeBcJi_oUfFxcS3gzUehqHADr_-1fWxkOwfySOO9cprCDdPa-Bk1I9ves5cKU6r6Bhaqq2P9NT5WHzXJsAkybW=w451-h640\" width=\"451\" /></a></div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: medium;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: 